      "example_text": "Input: nums1 = [2,4,6,8,10], nums2 = [2,4,6,8,10]\nOutput: 0\nExplanation: nums1 is equal to nums2 so no replacement is needed. This will result in an \nabsolute sum difference of 0.",
      "images": []
    },
    {
